00:02:20.011 --> 00:02:21.304
(gasps)

00:02:22.513 --> 00:02:24.056
Welcome, brother.

00:02:25.183 --> 00:02:26.517
(sniffing)

00:02:27.268 --> 00:02:30.646
Behold, Scratlantis.

00:02:35.443 --> 00:02:38.529
(animals murmuring)

00:02:42.533 --> 00:02:43.451
