00:02:45.786 --> 00:02:46.621
Hmm.

00:02:46.704 --> 00:02:47.955
(gasps)

00:02:50.416 --> 00:02:51.584
Aha.

00:02:54.795 --> 00:02:56.714
(sighs)

00:02:56.797 --> 00:02:58.090
(laughing hysterically)

00:02:58.716 --> 00:02:59.675
(gasps)

